 "2026-09-05T23:00:00Z", "id": "sync-d7c91dabe6e413cca1b7d0d6d8dc7a15", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 68}, {"extId": "b4077e17d5393758cd18778ca067bd0a", "sport": "NCAAF", "week": "Week 2", "away": "Nicholls State Colonels", "home": "Kansas State Wildcats", "favorite": "home", "spread": 40.5, "total": 55.5, "kickoff": "2026-09-05T23:00:00Z", "id": "sync-b4077e17d5393758cd18778ca067bd0a", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 69}, {"extId": "965fa47588c773e6753d409fc1020dec", "sport": "NCAAF", "week": "Week 2", "away": "Western Michigan Broncos", "home": "Michigan Wolverines", "favorite": "home", "spread": 27.5, "total": 47.5, "kickoff": "2026-09-05T23:00:00Z", "id": "sync-965fa47588c773e6753d409fc1020dec", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 70}, {"extId": "19db717a66097e6d3fb887ae8cf3aaae", "sport": "NCAAF", "week": "Week 2", "away": "Missouri State Bears", "home": "Texas A&M Aggies", "favorite": "home", "spread": 41.5, "total": 52.5, "kickoff": "2026-09-05T23:00:00Z", "id": "sync-19db717a66097e6d3fb887ae8cf3aaae", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 71}, {"extId": "073bba47dc105fcd66913e74f281ae96", "sport": "NCAAF", "week": "Week 2", "away": "Clemson Tigers", "home": "LSU Tigers", "favorite": "home", "spread": 10.5, "total": 51.5, "kickoff": "2026-09-05T23:30:00Z", "id": "sync-073bba47dc105fcd66913e74f281ae96", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 72}, {"extId": "61a35dab6017f6f7de74fab10707197c", "sport": "NCAAF", "week": "Week 2", "away": "UL Monroe Warhawks", "home": "Mississippi State Bulldogs", "favorite": "home", "spread": 28.5, "total": 56.5, "kickoff": "2026-09-05T23:30:00Z", "id": "sync-61a35dab6017f6f7de74fab10707197c", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 73}, {"extId": "516f500b559017bc6c6f127259da99f1", "sport": "NCAAF", "week": "Week 2", "away": "VMI Keydets", "home": "Virginia Tech Hokies", "favorite": "home", "spread": 50.5, "total": 57.5, "kickoff": "2026-09-05T23:30:00Z", "id": "sync-516f500b559017bc6c6f127259da99f1", "status": "open", "finalHome": null, "finalAway": null, "order": 74}], "wagers": [{"id": "i4bpapoyrxe5", "gameId": "sync-e564afb0a5ab84ab43befa56bdb90522", "player": "antmiceli", "type": "ATS", "pick": "home", "points": 100}, {"id": "lz3qbulqrxe5", "gameId": "sync-e564afb0a5ab84ab43befa56bdb90522", "player": "antmiceli", "type": "OU", "pick": "under", "points": 501}], "announcements": [], "adjustments": [], "weekVisibility": {"NCAAF|Week 2": true}, "rulesText": "Contact \\n8609108805\\nAmiceli81@gmail.com\\n \\nThe league will be run using the website http://www.officefootballpool.com. The app has been eliminated by OFP.  You can make a bookmark on your phone to the website and it loads with a mobile experience similar to the app. If you old ass people need help making a bookmark let me know.\\n \\nRules\\n \\n1)     The Game runs for the length of the NFL regular season.  (No Playoffs). New this year the wagering week starts on Tuesday at 12:00am and ends at the kickoff of the last Monday Night Football game. You can still only wager on games played Thursday - Monday.  NOTE: If you have your wagers in for the week and I find that you broke any rules requiring point deductions the prior week all wagers will be voided and I will reduce your points.  You will be notified and you will be required to reenter your wagers.\\n\\n2)     Each week you must risk at least half of your points/shares on a minimum of 4 different bets.  Taking the winner/loser and the over/under in a single game does count as 2 different bets. You can risk shares on as many college and/or pro games as you\\u2019d like, as long as you make at least 4 different bets.\\n\\n3)    You must risk at least half your points/shares every week.\\n     A)    You may divide the shares up between the games, anyway you choose.\\n     B)    Minimum wager on any game is 100 points/shares. This year correction wagers are allowed.  EX. If you wager 40 in       error with the actual intention of 400 you can enter a wager of 360 on the exact same bet and I will not penalize you.                                       \\n     C)   There is no way to set an option on the site to make sure everyone wagers half of their shares each week.  However, I will check everyone\\u2019s selections, and make the necessary adjustments.  If you do not wager half of your shares, the managers will take away the shares up to half of your total.  \\n \\n4)  ALL PICKS MUST BE SUBMITTED BEFORE KICKOFF OF YOUR FIRST GAME.  Within a given week, there is no re-betting winnings or chasing loses.  For example, you can not take shares won from college games on Saturday and then use them on NFL bets on Sunday or Monday.        \\n\\n    A)  For all bets that are made after the kickoff of your first game, winnings will be subtracted and losses will stand.  More points/shares may be lost as well to make sure you wagered half of your points/shares. There is no way to set an option on the site to make sure you place all of your wagers before your first game, so make sure you know what your doing before confirming picks.\\n     B) You do not have to put all your picks in at once, they just all have to be in before kickoff of your first game.\\n     C)  All wagers placed on the site are time stamped. \\n     D)  Make sure your picks are accurate before you submit them.  League administrators will not change picks for guys that make mistakes.  You can''t call your bookie and change a bet you''ve made...\\n \\n5)  The site will provide all lines for the games. They do not always set the spread to end with 1/2 point. \\n     A)  Spreads can change day to day.  At the time you select your games, those lines are locked in to your picks.  Guys placing wagers on Thursday on college and pro games may have different lines than guys that only wager on Sunday\\u2019s pro games.\\n     B)  Once you select and confirm your pick(s), they\\u2019re locked in.  Do not call/text/email asking for a pick to be voided or changed.  \\n     C) You CAN select the same team, in the same game, a second time, if the spread changes later in the week.  You must take four different games first.  Then you must make sure that all other picks are made BEFORE kickoff of your first game of the week.  Understand that this will count as a whole different wager.  \\n     For example, let\\u2019s say you love the Pats this week.  You place your bets:\\n  \\t                 NE  -7\\tvs  \\tBuf\\t\\t1000 \\n\\t\\t\\tNYG  -3\\tvs\\tJax\\t\\t500\\n\\t\\t\\tNYJ  +6\\tvs\\tNO\\t\\t500\\n\\t\\t\\tSF\\t-2\\tvs\\tSea\\t\\t500\\n\\n\\tThe kickoff of your first game has not occurred and the line drops, so you want to take the Pats again.  That\\u2019s fine.\\n\\n                         NE  -5.5 \\tvs\\tBuf\\t\\t1500\\n\\t\\n\\t\\t\\tTotal wagered\\t4000 \\n \\n \\n6)  If you miss putting in your selections, that will be the equivalent of going 0-4.  You will lose half of your points/shares.\\n \\n7) You can only wager points/shares on one team per contest.  We\\u2019ve always figured this was obvious but\\u2026  Even if each bet uses a different line or point total. If you wager on both the loss stands.  If you wager on both the win will be removed and that original wager deducted as well. \\n \\n8)  An additional 2,500 shares can be obtained for $50 once during the season.   Play must be continuous.  Can\\u2019t take a week off ( be out of points Week 5, and buyback in Week 7).    The Buyback 2500 has to be paid immediately though PayPal/Venmo.  After receiving the  PayPal/Venmo confirmation email and text/call to 8609108805, the 2500 shares will be credited.  No points/shares will be added in the last 3 weeks of the season, meaning they must be bought prior to week 16 of the NFL.\\n \\n9)  If you fall below 400 shares, you are out unless you decide to add the extra 2500 points/shares.\\n \\n10)  I have the power to pull games off the board for inaccurate lines.  For example:  Alabama is playing Southwestern Texas Community College.  The line says \\u201cAlabama is getting 20 pts\\u201d.\\n \\n11.Pay before Week 5 no later than kick off of the October 6th Monday Night Football NFL Game .  Either by Venmo @amiceli81 or PayPal @AMiceli1981 only.\\n\\n12)  As long as you place 4 rule abiding bets between Thursday September 4 and the end of Monday Night Football September 8 your team is valid.  No teams can join after the first week of the NFL Season.\\n \\n13)  Payouts: \\nFirst place \\u2013 55%     \\t\\nSecond place \\u2013 25%    \\nThird place \\u2013  10%     \\nFourth and Fifth place - 5% each\\t"}')
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE data = VALUES(data);
